10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,000
I still have the ability to add a highlight and notes to request.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:10,000
And you can see that these still carry across to the proxy history.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
I can also change the forward button to a forward all for an easy way to clear the queue.

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
And when I'm done I simply turn intercept off.

14
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
So hopefully these changes will make your workflow faster and more efficient and we'd love to hear any feedback that you have.

